### Read all films with File variable
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
GET {{baseUrl}}/films


### Read a single film
GET {{baseUrl}}/films/3

### Read all films cheaper or equal to 3 €
GET {{baseUrl}}/films/?minimum-duration=140

### Create a drink
POST {{baseUrl}}/films
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Ducobu v2",
    "director": "Moi",
    "duration": 120,
    "imageUrl": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}